  "migration_notes": "RFC-042 details Orders API v2 breaking changes affecting REST, gRPC, and DB schema. Consumer migration guidance requires billing-service to implement tolerant readers that support both v1 and v2 formats simultaneously before orders-service deploys migration 0002_money_customer_status. For REST, read total.amount_minor when present, else round(total_price * 100), read customer.display_name when present, else customer_name, and treat both PENDING and AWAITING_PAYMENT as not payable. For gRPC, vendor v2 proto with fields 2 and 3 re-declared as deprecated to inspect HasField. For SQL, inspect alembic_version to branch between SUM(total_price) for 0001 and SUM(total_minor) for 0002."
